    "name": "Capability-Conditioned Transition",
    "version": "v1",
    "description": "Withdrawal gating conditioned strictly on indigenous forces satisfying pre-registered autonomous capability criteria (Omega_min >= 1.0, readiness >= 0.70). Prevents premature abandonment.",
    "intended_hypotheses": ["PF-H1", "PF-H2", "PF-H3"],
